abstract: "An open-source, machine learning-based flood risk prediction and
  GIS decision support framework for disaster risk reduction, evaluated on a
  purpose-built Sindh (Pakistan) 2010-2024 dataset. Includes a FastAPI +
  PostgreSQL/PostGIS backend, an automated early warning cycle with push
  notifications, a Leaflet decision-support dashboard, and a Flutter
  community mobile application with verified citizen reporting."
